{
  "name": "npm-floor",
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "homepage": "https://lab-cws.pages.dev/npm-floor/",
  "_homepageNote": "npm のパッケージページの右側に出る唯一のリンク欄。公開リポジトリは未作成（404 を出さないので repository/bugs は入れない）。0.1.0 の README には販売ページの URL が 1 箇所も無く、npm から購入ページへ渡る橋が存在しなかった（判断監査 J-SHIP-BOTTLENECK 指摘1・2026-09-30）。",
  "description": "How many downloads would your package get if nobody used it? Tells you that number (the floor: mirrors, CI caches, security scanners) and whether your actual count stands out from it. — 利用者ゼロでも付く DL は何件か。自分のパッケージはそれを超えているか。",
  "keywords": [
    "npm",
    "downloads",
    "download-count",
    "download-stats",
    "bots",
    "mirrors",
    "scanners",
    "baseline",
    "floor",
    "version-pumping",
    "supply-chain",
    "statistics"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "metamol0627",
  "type": "module",
  "bin": {
    "npm-floor": "bin/npm-floor.mjs"
  },
  "main": "lib/floor.mjs",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/floor.mjs",
    "./api": "./lib/api.mjs",
    "./calibrate": "./lib/calibrate.mjs",
    "./dates": "./lib/dates.mjs",
    "./cohorts": "./data/cohorts.json",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "bin/",
    "lib/",
    "data/cohorts.json",
    "docs/method.md",
    "docs/field-log.md",
    "README.md",
    "README.ja.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20.0.0"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test tests/*.test.mjs",
    "calibrate": "node bin/npm-floor.mjs calibrate",
    "build:dataset": "node scripts/build_dataset.mjs",
    "fieldlog": "node scripts/field_log.mjs",
    "demo": "node scripts/readme_demo.mjs",
    "check:claims": "node scripts/check_claims.mjs",
    "check:sale": "node ../../scripts/check_sale_status.mjs npm-floor"
  },
  "dependencies": {}
}
